[["Map",1,2,18,19],"devlog",["Map",3,4],"001-announcing-catastrophe-cafe",{"id":3,"data":5,"body":14,"filePath":15,"digest":16,"deferredRender":17},{"num":6,"title":7,"date":8,"minutes":9,"tags":10,"weekOf":12,"summary":13},"001","Announcing Catastrophe Cafe","2025.09.18",2,[11],"origin","WEEK 01","A multiplayer game about running a cat cafe. It gets chaotic fast, especially once the orange cats show up.","So I'm making a game. It's called Catastrophe Cafe.\n\nThe concept is pretty simple: you and some friends are running a cat cafe. Serve customers, manage the cafe, try to keep things from falling apart. It sounds manageable until you get a few orange cats on your hands, and then suddenly it really isn't.\n\nIt's still very much a work in progress, but I have a lot of ideas I'm genuinely excited about and I want somewhere to talk about them as I build. That's what this devlog is for.\n\nThe multiplayer angle came from a pretty honest place: my friends and I are running out of games to play together. So I figured I'd just make one. It also helps that I love cats. Dogs too, but I've never seen a dog cafe, so here we are.\n\nI'll be posting updates here as things move forward. No schedule, just whenever there's something worth writing about.","src/content/devlog/001-announcing-catastrophe-cafe.mdx","1e35f077733ede24",true,"meta::meta",["Map",20,21,22,23,24,25],"astro-config-digest","{\"root\":{},\"srcDir\":{},\"publicDir\":{},\"outDir\":{},\"cacheDir\":{},\"site\":\"https://itsdivit.me\",\"compressHTML\":true,\"base\":\"/\",\"trailingSlash\":\"ignore\",\"output\":\"static\",\"scopedStyleStrategy\":\"attribute\",\"build\":{\"format\":\"directory\",\"client\":{},\"server\":{},\"assets\":\"_astro\",\"serverEntry\":\"entry.mjs\",\"redirects\":true,\"inlineStylesheets\":\"auto\",\"concurrency\":1},\"server\":{\"open\":false,\"host\":false,\"port\":4321,\"allowedHosts\":[]},\"redirects\":{},\"image\":{\"endpoint\":{\"route\":\"/_image\"},\"service\":{\"entrypoint\":\"astro/